This command is provided for controlling  CD‐ROM  changer  mecha‐
nisms  which  cannot  use the standard changer control interface.
ATAPI CD‐ROM changers fall into this category.  There are 3  sub‐
commands: Loads the media from the specified slot into the CD‐ROM
drive.  Unloads the media from the CD‐ROM drive and returns it to
the specified slot.  Aborts any pending load or unload operation.
